  "details": "For avatars with particularly short fingers, their colliders will be automatically be extended to an arbitrary minimum no matter how short you set them on the avatar descriptor.\n\nIn this particular example rig, the avatar only has the fingers weighted to their proximal bones with a short leaf bone added to allow for them to have colliders. But any height value I set them to that is lower than the arbitrary default will not match in-game as it will get extended once uploaded.",
